WEBVTT

00:00:00.117 --> 00:00:05.772
Adding vehicles

00:00:05.822 --> 00:00:09.875
Open Transport and Vehicles, then press Add Vehicle.

00:00:19.835 --> 00:00:24.409
Enter the number plate, choose the type, the seats, and the make.

00:00:35.346 --> 00:00:40.244
Enter the driver name and phone, then choose the route this vehicle serves.

00:00:47.930 --> 00:00:52.938
Press Add Vehicle. It appears in the list with its driver and route.

00:00:56.790 --> 00:01:01.448
Vehicle added
